meta {
  name: S3 — Tenant user signs in, scoped to tenant
  seq: 3
}

docs {
  TICK-45. Sign in through Keycloak, call `GET /api/v1/me`, then the refused tokens: none, garbage, tampered, an ID token, a foreign issuer, an operator token, no organization and two organizations. The expired-token check is in the last folder (Z), because it waits for a 5-minute token to expire. Needs `tools/seed.sh`.
}
